+§15 Bugs	The "as is" disclaimer is unnecessary in its current form.	Remove that phrase and retain the more precise explanation of realistic service limitations.
+§17 Disputes	International consumer support and language availability are not addressed.	Match legal documents and support arrangements to the actual target markets.
